  "description": "Erection of additional storey to provide 1x self-contained flat.\r",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, due to its size, siting, design, bulk and mass, would be harmful to the character and appearance of the existing building, adjacent buildings and character and appearance of the surrounding area.  It would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Core Strategy (2010) Policy CP30, Policies DMD6, DMD8, DMD13 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014)",
    "The proposed development, including the roof terrace, by reason of its siting, scale, design, height, bulk and elevated position, would result in an unneighbourly and overbearing form of development causing increased overshadowing, enclosure, overlooking and loss of privacy to the rear habitable room windows and private amenity space of No.152A and adjoining properties. The proposal would therefore cause unacceptable harm to neighbouring residential amenity, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD8, DMD9 and DMD13 of the Development Management Document (2014)"
  ],
